# roll_order.rec: the order D1 walks a table in when it rolls from it (1.09's AllItemsList and UniqueItemList).
# Which entry a random roll lands on depends on it, so it is spelled out here rather than taken from the order
# records happen to sit in their own files. One record per table; each id is an internal_name, listed once.
# Records a list leaves out come after the listed ones, sorted by internal_name.

